  "description": "The Just Juice Bar Range Sour Blue Razz Lime Nic Salt e-liquid is a tangy and refreshing fusion of sweet-and-sour Blue Raspberry with the citrusy zing of fresh Lime. This bold flavour delivers a vibrant burst of fruitiness, perfectly balanced with a tart edge to create an unforgettable vaping experience for fans of sour-inspired blends. Crafted with a 60PG/40VG ratio, this Nicotine Salt e-liquid is designed for use with Mouth-to-Lung (MTL) devices and pod systems, offering smooth throat hits and fast-acting nicotine satisfaction. Available in 5mg, 10mg, and 20mg strengths, Sour Blue Razz Lime is perfect for vapers seeking bold, tangy flavours they can enjoy all day long. Part of the Just Juice Bar Range, this collection delivers the intense, concentrated flavours associated with disposable vapes, but in a more versatile and economical format for reusable vapes and vape starter kits . Other popular flavours in the range include Lychee & Mango, Blackcurrant Lemonade, and Iced Caramel Macchiato. Please Note : All flavours in the Just Juice Bar Range feature a subtle hint of ice to enhance the flavour profile.",
